{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"agent_message","text":"**What I Did**\n\n- Added the Hedera JavaScript SDK (`@hashgraph/sdk@2.81.0`) to `package.json`.\n- Created `src/transfer.ts` that:\n  - Loads environment variables via `dotenv`.\n  - Reads `OPERATOR_ID`, `OPERATOR_KEY` (DER‑encoded hex), `RECIPIENT_ID`, and `VALID_START`.\n  - Constructs a `TransactionId` with the supplied valid‑start timestamp.\n  - Builds a `TransferTransaction` moving **1 hbar** from the operator to the recipient, sets node `0.0.3`, and adds memo `invoice 42`.\n  - Freezes, signs the transaction offline with the operator key, and prints the signed transaction bytes as a hex string.\n- Confirmed the project compiles with `npx tsc --noEmit` (no TypeScript errors).  \n- The script runs with `npx tsx src/transfer.ts` and performs all actions offline, never submitting to the Hedera network."}}
